# Dotfiles managed by this repo — one symlink PER ENTRY, never a whole directory.
#
#   base | source | dest | note
#
#   base   : config  -> dest is relative to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME (default ~/.config)
#            home    -> dest is relative to $HOME
#   source : path relative to the repo root (INSTALL_REPO_DIR)
#   dest   : path relative to the chosen base. No "..", no absolute paths.
#
# Per-entry linking is deliberate: ~/.config/hypr/ stays a real directory, so a
# machine-local file the installer generates later — e.g.
# ~/.config/hypr/monitors.local.lua — lives beside the symlinks, is never in
# git, and is never touched by `install.sh dotfiles`.
#
# No entries yet. The desktop / power stages add the Hyprland, Quickshell,
# hypridle and hyprlock configs here as they create them.
#
# Example (commented out — the source does not exist yet):
# config | config/hypr/hyprland.lua        | hypr/hyprland.lua
# config | config/hypr/modules/infinite-desktop.lua | hypr/modules/infinite-desktop.lua
# config | config/quickshell/shell.qml     | quickshell/shell.qml
# config | config/hypr/hypridle.conf       | hypr/hypridle.conf
# config | config/hypr/hyprlock.conf       | hypr/hyprlock.conf
